# IslandEvent: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_IslandEvent.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen IRICE-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
ipc island demo download
wait 1
ptr glide 960 50 300
wait 0.4
shot alert-hover
note the alert with Open (filled) and Show in Folder (outlined); a round x over the glyph's top-left
ptr glide 1050 50 200
ptr click
wait 1
shot after-button
note the button ran and the alert left
ptr glide 1500 600 300
ipc island demo connect
wait 1
ptr glide 1100 50 300
ptr click
wait 1
shot connecting
note the alert changed in place to "Connecting... keep the case open nearby"
ptr glide 1500 600 300
wait 25
ipc island demo usb
wait 1
ptr glide 790 40 300
wait 0.4
ptr glide 778 33 100
ptr click
wait 1
shot closed-by-x
note the x removed it
ipc island demo usb
wait 1
ptr glide 960 50 300
ptr scroll 0 -4
wait 0.5
shot tiny-tick
note a single small touchpad tick does NOT dismiss it
ptr scroll 0 -15
wait 0.8
shot notch
note one wheel notch up dismisses it
ptr glide 1500 600 300
ipc island demo download
wait 1
ptr glide 900 50 300
ptr click
ptr glide 1500 600 300
wait 8
shot not-stuck
note after a click and leaving, the alert still times out (no stuck x, no stuck hold); download lives 10 min in QML too: use demo wifi for a 5 s check
ipc island demo wifi
wait 1
ptr glide 900 50 300
ptr click
ptr glide 1500 600 300
wait 7
shot wifi-gone
note the Wi-Fi alert left within ~6 s even after a click
ipc island demo usb
wait 1
ptr glide 900 50 300
ptr click
key -k Escape
wait 0.6
shot esc
note Escape removed the newest alert after a click
ipc island demo battery
wait 1
shot battery-red
note Material: the red disc's icon is on-error (light); colour names read (red, not accent)
ptr glide 1500 600 300

look glass
